  "title": "Don NDE 4798",
  "date": "1958",
  "content": "I was twelve years old. I died and left my body. While floating above my body, I looked at my hands and they were there. I had a body. I could hear the men in the room saying 'He sure is young to have to die.' I tried to tell them I'm not dead. But they could not hear me. Out of the corner of my eye, I saw a small light coming at me or I was going to it. As the light got closer to me, I began to feel love. As the light got closer, in the light was a man. He said, 'What are you doing here?' He called me by my name. The light was around him and me; it was a pure feeling of love. I asked him, 'Who are you?' He said, 'I'm your brother.' It looked like he was surprised that I was there and of the question. By now, I was thinking I am in heaven and this is an angel. The first question was 'What was I going to do in heaven?' I was sitting on some steps. I said, 'Is it going to be my job to shine these steps?' He said, 'No, Donald. The reason I made them of gold was so they would not have to be shined. I'm you brother and I want to serve you. I went away to build this place for you.' Oh yes, he did not speak words. They would just come into my mind what he was saying. I asked 'Where is heaven?' He showed me. I asked many questions and he answered them. When I was done, he said I had something to do and I will have to go back. I came back into my body.",
